    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89970" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπληρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill up</i> or <i>complete</i> a number, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππέας π. εἰς δισχιλίους</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.3.24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				1.6.3
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				421.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>: esp. <i>man and equip</i> ships
				<i>besides, man still more</i> ships, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.104
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7.34
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ Κερκύρας ἄλλας
			π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.66
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.1.27
			</span></i>.</div>
